#: ../../source/user_guide/client_api.rst:10
msgid "Replica management"
msgstr "副本管理"

#: ../../source/user_guide/client_api.rst:12
msgid "The synchronous and asynchronous clients accept ``replica_config`` in ``launch_model`` and expose ``add_model_replica`` and ``terminate_model_replica`` for running models. See :ref:`launch` for the request structure, placement rules, and examples."
msgstr "同步和异步客户端的 ``launch_model`` 都接受 ``replica_config`` 参数，并提供 ``add_model_replica`` 和 ``terminate_model_replica`` 来管理运行中的模型副本。请求结构、放置规则和示例参见 :ref:`launch`。"

