#: ../../source/user_guide/client_api.rst:381
msgid "Speaker Embeddings"
msgstr "说话人嵌入"

#: ../../source/user_guide/client_api.rst:383
msgid "Speaker-embedding audio models extract a fixed-length representation of speaker identity. Xinference provides two built-in CAMPPlus models: ``speech_campplus_sv_zh-cn_16k-common`` and ``speech_campplus_sv_zh_en_16k-common_advanced``. Both return a 192-dimensional vector through the ``speaker_embedding`` ability."
msgstr "说话人嵌入音频模型用于提取表示说话人身份的定长向量。Xinference 提供两个内置 CAMPPlus 模型：``speech_campplus_sv_zh-cn_16k-common`` 和 ``speech_campplus_sv_zh_en_16k-common_advanced``。两者都通过 ``speaker_embedding`` 能力返回一个 192 维向量。"

